meta {
  name: Chat
  seq: 6
}

docs {
  One conversation per (listing, buyer).

  Conversation: `id, listing_detail {id, book, price, listing_type, status}, buyer, seller,
  last_message, unread_count, created_at, updated_at`

  Message: `id, conversation, sender (user id), body, created_at, read_at`

  **WebSockets** (signed in by the same `access_token` cookie):

  - `ws://localhost:8000/ws/chat/<conversation_id>/` for one conversation
  - `ws://localhost:8000/ws/inbox/` for new messages from anyone (unread badges)

  Client -> server: `{"type":"message","body":"..."}`, `{"type":"typing","is_typing":true}`,
  `{"type":"read"}`. Server -> client: `message`, `typing`, `read` and `error` events.
  Close codes: `4401` not signed in, `4403` not a participant. Limit: 30 messages a minute.
}
